---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = "My LDT Portfolio";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <p>Welcome to my portfolio website. This is my first time coding a website from scratch, and I'm going to be using this as a learning project, which will eventually become what I show employers when I graduate from LDT.</p>
		<p>I started out by using a combination of Astro and Netlify, which were recommended to me by Claude AI. I used <a href="https://docs.astro.build/en/tutorial/0-introduction/">Astro's blog tutorial</a> to start out.</p>
</BaseLayout>